<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady/firm - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady/firm - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were steady to firm. Demand was moderate with a moderate movement. Top $51.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  49.50-51.00 Few 49.00 &amp; 51.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  43.50-49.00</p>
<p>		210-230 lbs.  38.50-43.50</p>
<p>Sows - weak/off $2.00. Top $48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 40.00-43.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs. 43.00-45.00</p>
<p>		500-650 lbs. 45.00-48.00</p>
</text>
